  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f-2" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="padding-left:36pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:120%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;Interim Financial&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;Statements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:150%"&gt;The interim financial statements and selected notes to the financial statements of Vantage Pipeline US LP (&#8220;the &#8220;Company&#8221;) should be read in conjunction with the Annual Form 6 financial statements and notes to the financial statements for the year ended December 31, 2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:150%"&gt;As at and for the three months ended March 31, 2026, there were no significant changes to the Company&#8217;s Annual Form 6 notes to the financial statements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
